+<form id="deliveryForm" class="admin-card wide delivery-admin">
+ <div class="card-number">06 / QR &amp; AUTO RETURN</div><h2>A smooth hand-off.</h2>
+ <p class="small muted">No guest playback, approval or Finish button. The QR countdown returns straight to Start; it does not add the thank-you delay.</p>
+ <div class="delivery-settings-grid">
+  <label>After recording<select id="postRecordMode"><option value="smart">Smart: skip QR after confirmed QR printing</option><option value="screen">Screen QR only / no print attempt</option><option value="both">Print + always show screen QR</option></select></label>
+  <label>QR display time (5-60 seconds)<input type="number" min="5" max="60" step="1" id="qrDisplaySeconds" value="10" required></label>
+  <label>Maximum print-result wait (1-15 seconds)<input type="number" min="1" max="15" step="1" id="printWaitSeconds" value="4" required></label>
+ </div>
+ <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="receiptPrintEnabled"> Enable receipt-print route (no physical adapter in this build)</label>
+ <p class="delivery-safe-note">Connected is not printed. Queued, sent-unconfirmed, timeout or uncertain results keep the screen QR. Photo-only receipts never qualify for QR bypass.</p>
+ <div class="button-row"><button type="submit" class="btn primary">Save QR &amp; return settings</button><button type="button" id="deliveryReturn" class="btn secondary">Return without saving</button></div><p id="deliverySaveStatus" class="small muted" role="status"></p>
+ <div class="delivery-lab"><strong>Flow simulation / DEMO recordings only</strong>
+ <label>Next demo recordings use<select id="deliveryScenario"><option value="not_connected">No printer (default)</option><option value="connected_only">Connected only / no job completion</option><option value="printed_confirmed">Confirmed QR print (SIMULATED, no paper)</option><option value="sent_unconfirmed">Sent, paper not confirmed</option><option value="failed_before_send">Failed before sending / offline</option><option value="outcome_unknown">Interrupted / outcome unknown</option><option value="timeout">No result / wait timeout</option></select></label>
+ <p class="small muted">This choice resets on reload, sends no Bluetooth data and cannot bypass QR for real webcam recordings. Disable the camera to test the simulated print branch. The existing Fail Print simulation takes priority.</p>
+ </div>
+</form>
